&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h1&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;About Flipp&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Flipp partners with the largest North American retailers and brands to deliver local promotions and savings to millions of engaged shoppers daily, driving superior returns on investments.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We help people make smarter shopping decisions with autonomy and accountability. With rising living costs, Flipp&#39;s mission is crucial. Our Shopper Consideration Platform allows retailers and manufacturers to create digital experiences from their savings &amp;amp; deals content, aiding shoppers in deciding what to buy and where to buy it. Together, we make a difference.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our five principles, Progress Over Perfection, Clarity Through Transparency, Learn Loudly, Challenge with Empathy, and Always Build Better, bring a relentless progress mindset to life. They’re not just slogans, but they’re the behaviours we expect, reward, and hold ourselves accountable to. You&#39;ll be equipped to make an impact, realize your potential, and stay inspired every step of the way.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;The &lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Marketing Science&lt;/strong&gt; team at Flipp works cross-functionally with clients, analysts, and external partnerships to executive campaigns at the highest level of effectiveness. The Senior Marketing Science Analyst acts as an analytical consultant for Flipp’s business development and product teams, in support of Retail, Brand, and Media partners. You assess the business situation, select the appropriate testing &amp;amp; measurement approach and derive actionable insights to deliver business performance. You collaborate effectively with peers and mentor entry level analysts both technically and methodologically. You are the operator of the request model and the keepers of the cadence. This profile makes the two-way pipeline real: intake flowing in from the regional teams in every market, and structured, prioritized requests flowing out to Product and Data Engineering.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll get the opportunity to do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Plan &amp;amp; Design&lt;/strong&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;931&quot;&gt;E2e delivery of testing &amp;amp; measurement process - setup, execution &amp;amp; analysis - w/minimal support&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1030&quot;&gt;Selects best-fit approach based on Flipp testing &amp;amp; measurement best practices&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1111&quot;&gt;Advises overall testing &amp;amp; measurement plan design&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1164&quot;&gt;Manages assigned tickets in JIRA workflow w/minimal support&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1227&quot;&gt;Contributes to development &amp;amp; delivery of strategic analytics roadmap for assigned portfolio&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1322&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Data Preparation &amp;amp; Modeling&lt;/strong&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1353&quot;&gt;Highly proficient in data extraction, manipulation and aggregation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1423&quot;&gt;Effectively navigate enterprise level systems &amp;amp; large datasets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1489&quot;&gt;Strong understanding of Flipp&#39;s data models, limitations &amp;amp; relevant applications&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1573&quot;&gt;Identify process efficiency opportunities &amp;amp; develop working prototypes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1647&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Analysis &amp;amp; Measurement&lt;/strong&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficient with foundational statistical concepts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep expertise in digital marketing attribution and incrementality measurement&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Execute Flipp testing &amp;amp; measurement playbooks and improvises creatively w/data off script&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify root cause issues &amp;amp; scalable opportunities through strong diagnostic analysis &amp;amp; curiosity&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Investigates and drives to resolution on identified data anomalies&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Apply and help improve measurement standards, intake criteria, service expectations, escalation protocols, documentation requirements, and quality-control practices across assigned work&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assess incoming requests for business value, urgency, feasibility, data readiness, and appropriate measurement path, then classify, prioritize, and route them accordingly.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2073&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Generating &amp;amp; Delivering Insights&lt;/strong&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2109&quot;&gt;Drives meaningful action by extracting &quot;&quot;So What&quot;&quot; &amp;amp; &quot;&quot;Now What&quot;&quot; in d2d analysis&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2194&quot;&gt;Develops compelling, insightful and tailored analysis and measurement approaches to answer ambiguous business challenges&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2318&quot;&gt;Utilizes industry leading BI tools to effectively visualize key insights&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2394&quot;&gt;Adept at presenting analysis to both technical and non-technical internal audiences &amp;amp; assigned external stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Translate commercial and client measurement needs into clear, analytical, Product, Data Science, and Data Engineering requirements, including scope, dependencies, acceptance criteria, and expected business outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2514&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Innovation &amp;amp; Growth&lt;/strong&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2537&quot;&gt;Actively expands skills &amp;amp; knowledge both technically and in digital marketing &amp;amp; measurement&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2632&quot;&gt;Contribute to development &amp;amp; documentation of internal testing &amp;amp; measurement best practices&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2726&quot;&gt;Contributes to x-functional testing &amp;amp; measurement innovation initiatives&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2802&quot;&gt;Lead the integration of advanced analytics and research into client deliverables and business reviews&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2907&quot;&gt;Define data requirements for product and data science / engineering teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Produce process improvement documentation that records the actions, findings, limitations, reusable assets, and lessons learned so successful approaches can be replicated across future projects.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll bring to the team:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;4152&quot;&gt;Post secondary degree in a quantitative discipline such as Statistics/Math/Finance/Economics/Business Engineering or similar field&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;4286&quot;&gt;3+ years experience as a data analyst delivering continued business impact&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;4366&quot;&gt;Advanced technical ability in data extraction and analysis - SQL, Python, Scala, R&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;4454&quot;&gt;Experience analyzing &amp;amp; visualizing data w/industry leading BI tools - tableau, PowerBI, Thoughtspot, Looker&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;4567&quot;&gt;Foundational knowledge of cloud data platforms - AWS, Azure, GCP&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;4637&quot;&gt;Experience working with databricks an asset&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;4686&quot;&gt;Strong understanding of Retail, CPG, digital measurement &amp;amp; consumer insights&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;4768&quot;&gt;Self-starter, highly effective working independently and within a team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;4768&quot;&gt;Experience developing analytical standards, QA practices, SOPs, reusable frameworks, and documentation that support consistent execution across analysts, clients, or markets&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;4768&quot;&gt;Proven ability to translate ambiguous commercial or client needs into clear analytical, data, product, and engineering requirements&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;4768&quot;&gt;Strong experience managing multiple concurrent measurement initiatives, including prioritization, scope, dependencies, timelines, risks, and Jira-based workflows&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;4768&quot;&gt;Experience advising senior internal and external stakeholders, challenging assumptions, managing expectations, and managing delivery timelines.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;column&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 18px;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;How We Support You&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our Total Rewards philosophy is to ensure that you are rewarded for impact, take part in accelerated career growth, thrive with highly flexible benefits, and are empowered to do your best work in a remote-first environment. In alignment with our overall Total Rewards Philosophy, we believe compensation should be fair, clear, consistent, and aligned to growth.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Canada Base Hiring Range:&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$73,000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$91,000 CAD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h1&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;Our promise to each other:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;table style=&quot;width: 83.5859%;&quot;&gt;
&lt;tbody&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td style=&quot;width: 53.174%;&quot;&gt;
&lt;h5&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we bring:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h5&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style=&quot;width: 46.8272%;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you bring:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td style=&quot;width: 53.174%;&quot;&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An inclusive, collaborative environment where your voice matters&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A remote-first environment&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The tools and opportunities you need to grow and develop&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Every opportunity to own your success&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style=&quot;width: 46.8272%;&quot;&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Your authentic self, every day&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Your best work, from anywhere&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An appetite for learning, curiosity, and a growth mindset&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Motivation, initiative and the mind of an entrepreneur&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;/tbody&gt;
&lt;/table&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;Here&#39;s how to apply:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This position is currently vacant and open for applications. If you’re interested in working with us on the future of shopping, fill out the fields below and submit your application. While experience and skill sets are valuable, growth potential and attitudes are equally important. If you’re prepared to grow dramatically with your team at a world-class learning organization, consider applying. We understand that the most creative solutions require diversity in thought and life experiences.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Flipp is an equal opportunity employer. We do not discriminate on the basis of race, color, ancestry, religion, creed, sex, national or ethnic origin, sexual orientation, age, citizenship, marital status, family status, disability, or gender identity or expression or any other protected grounds. We are proud to be a welcoming space for employees, of every background, to bring their whole selves to work with confidence. Flipp is committed to providing appropriate accommodations to ensure our selection process is equitable, and such accommodations can be made available on request. If you require an accommodation, please contact your dedicated recruiter directly.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Hiring is a deeply human process; therefore, we use AI in limited, administrative ways to help streamline our hiring process. An AI-powered scheduling tool assists with coordinating interviews, and our applicant tracking system may use AI to identify relevant keywords within applications. We do not use AI to assess your application, make hiring decisions, or conduct interviews. All evaluations are completed by real people.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;A member of our recruitment team will respond to you in the coming weeks.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
